    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ee0b4686df590e1306ba00948c375a6d.avif?t=1755089349\" width=720 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SwooshCat \u2013 A precision platformer starring an adorable feline! Master simple jumps and dashes to embark on a challenging yet delightful adventure. \ud83d\udc3e</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slash, Parry, Break, Dodge \u2013 Your dash isn't just movement: it's a combat blade and puzzle key!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore lush jungles and scorching deserts, each meticulously packed with deadly traps and cunning mechanisms to challenge your skills and strategy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Turn foes into stepping stones \u2013 Chain kills, parries, and dashes to bounce off corpses and bullets, resetting mobility to reach &quot;impossible&quot; corners!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Easy to learn, deep to master: Newbies leap right in; speedrunners face brutal challenges!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buttery controls + Rich level design = An unmissable catventure! \ud83d\udc31</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ee0b4686df590e1306ba00948c375a6d.avif?t=1755089349\" width=720 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SwooshCat \u2013 A precision platformer starring an adorable feline! Master simple jumps and dashes to embark on a challenging yet delightful adventure. \ud83d\udc3e</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slash, Parry, Break, Dodge \u2013 Your dash isn't just movement: it's a combat blade and puzzle key!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore lush jungles and scorching deserts, each meticulously packed with deadly traps and cunning mechanisms to challenge your skills and strategy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Turn foes into stepping stones \u2013 Chain kills, parries, and dashes to bounce off corpses and bullets, resetting mobility to reach &quot;impossible&quot; corners!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Easy to learn, deep to master: Newbies leap right in; speedrunners face brutal challenges!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buttery controls + Rich level design = An unmissable catventure! \ud83d\udc31</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "SwooshCat is a vibrant precision-platformer adventure. Leap, dash, slash, stab, roll, and ricochet your way through a charming pixel world as you help a brave little cat \ud83d\udc3e explore and battle!",
